{"book":"esther","num":4,"verses":[{"en":"When Mordecai perceived all that was done, Mordecai rent his clothes, and put on sackcloth with ashes, and went out into the midst of the city, and cried with a loud and a bitter cry;","n":1,"sm":"Yaanoanoa o sa lutá, ma le anapogi na faia e Eseta Ua noa e Moretekai mea uma ua faia, ona saei ai lea e Moretekai ona ofu, ma ua ofu o iai le ie talatala ma le lefulefu, ma alu atu i totonu O le aai, ma alaga i le alaga tele ma ua lotulotu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Yaanoanoa"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"sa"},{"en":"","sm":"lutá,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"anapogi"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"Eseta"},{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"noa"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"Moretekai"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faia,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"saei"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"Moretekai"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"ofu,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ofu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"iai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ie"},{"en":"","sm":"talatala"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"lefulefu,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"alu"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"totonu"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"aai,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"alaga"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"alaga"},{"en":"","sm":"tele"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"lotulotu."}]},{"en":"And came even before the king's gate: for none might enter into the king's gate clothed with sackcloth.","n":2,"sm":"Ua alu atu lava o ia i luma o le faitotoa o le tupu, aua ua sa ona ulu atu i le faitotoa o le tupu a o ofu i le ie talatala.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"alu"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"la